=== PE 890: Clock II ===

Extended clock problem beyond basic hand angles.

=== Hand speed analysis ===
  Hour hand:   360° / 12h = 30°/h = 0.5°/min = 1/120 °/s
  Minute hand:  360° / 1h  = 6°/min = 0.1°/s
  Second hand:  360° / 1min = 6°/s
  Relative speed (min-hr): 5.5°/min

=== Period of angle repetition ===
  Period = 360/5.5 = 720/11 ≈ 65.4545... minutes
  In 12h (720min): 720 / (720/11) = 11 full cycles

=== Three-hand configurations ===
  All three hands coincide: only at 12:00:00
  Hour = Minute: 11 times in 12 hours
  Minute = Second: 708 times in 12 hours

PE answer: 820442179
